{
  "name": "Google Drive PDF \u2192 Qdrant RAG Indexer",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0001-0001-0001-000000000001",
      "name": "Run Indexer",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -640,
        0
      ],
      "notes": "Click 'Test workflow' to index all PDFs in your Google Drive folder."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "fileFolder",
        "operation": "search",
        "searchMethod": "query",
        "queryString": "'1kiyeVdh-lP45tH8uV-_8hpPVQc1DR_NK' in parents and mimeType = 'application/pdf' and trashed = false",
        "returnAll": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0001-0001-0001-000000000002",
      "name": "List All PDFs",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleDrive",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        -420,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "googleDriveOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Google Drive account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "batchSize": 1,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0001-0001-0001-000000000003",
      "name": "Process One by One",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitInBatches",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        -200,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "download",
        "fileId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "={{ $json.id }}",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "options": {
          "fileName": "={{ $json.name }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0001-0001-0001-000000000004",
      "name": "Download PDF",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleDrive",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        40,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "googleDriveOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Google Drive account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "insert",
        "qdrantCollection": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "n8n-rag",
          "mode": "list",
          "cachedResultName": "n8n-rag"
        },
        "options": {
          "embeddingBatchSize": 100
        }
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0001-0001-0001-000000000005",
      "name": "Store in Qdrant",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.vectorStoreQdrant",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        280,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "qdrantApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Qdrant account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "type": "binary",
        "loader": "pdfLoader",
        "binaryDataKey": "data",
        "options": {
          "metadata": {
            "metadataValues": [
              {
                "name": "file_id",
                "value": "={{ $('Process One by One').item.json.id }}"
              },
              {
                "name": "file_name",
                "value": "={{ $('Process One by One').item.json.name }}"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0001-0001-0001-000000000006",
      "name": "Load PDF",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.documentDefaultDataLoader",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        280,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chunkSize": 1000,
        "chunkOverlap": 200,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0001-0001-0001-000000000007",
      "name": "Split Text",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.textSplitterRecursiveCharacterTextSplitter",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        280,
        420
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "baseUrl": "http://ollama:11434",
        "model": "nomic-embed-text",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0001-0001-0001-000000000008",
      "name": "Ollama Embeddings",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.embeddingsOllama",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        520,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## \ud83d\udcc2 Google Drive PDF \u2192 Qdrant RAG Indexer\n\n### Setup (do once before running):\n\n**1. Google Drive Folder:**\n- The folder is pre-configured to your PDF folder (ID: 1kiyeVdh-lP45tH8uV-_8hpPVQc1DR_NK).\n- If you ever want to change it, open the 'List All PDFs' node and change the Folder ID.\n\n**2. Set credentials on both Google Drive nodes:**\n- Click each Google Drive node and select your Google Drive credential.\n\n**3. Set Qdrant credential:**\n- URL: `http://qdrant:6333`\n- No API key is needed.\n\n**4. Verify Ollama has the model:**\n- Ensure you have pulled `nomic-embed-text`.\n\n### How it works:\n- Lists ALL PDFs in your folder\n- Downloads and processes them one by one (avoids running out of memory)\n- Splits each PDF into 1000-char chunks with 200 overlap\n- Embeds via Ollama nomic-embed-text (768 dims)\n- Stores everything in local Qdrant collection `n8n-rag`",
        "height": 460,
        "width": 440,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0001-0001-0001-000000000009",
      "name": "Setup Instructions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -640,
        220
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Run Indexer": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "List All PDFs",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "List All PDFs": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Process One by One",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Process One by One": {
      "main": [
        [],
        [
          {
            "node": "Download PDF",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Download PDF": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Store in Qdrant",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Store in Qdrant": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Process One by One",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Load PDF": {
      "ai_document": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Store in Qdrant",
            "type": "ai_document",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Split Text": {
      "ai_textSplitter": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Load PDF",
            "type": "ai_textSplitter",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Ollama Embeddings": {
      "ai_embedding": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Store in Qdrant",
            "type": "ai_embedding",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "pinData": {},
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1",
    "saveManualExecutions": true,
    "callerPolicy": "workflowsFromSameOwner",
    "errorWorkflow": ""
  },
